ia Shadow Silencer","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_1535_wlfmster","slug":"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi","name":"Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi","database_level":1},{"enemy_id":"enemy_3004_speople","slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","database_level":0}],"suppliedUnits":{"fixed_squad":[],"deployable_tokens":[]},"hasConditionalSpawns":true},"borrowedGeometryFrom":null,"enemyDetails":{"elite_famiglia_crossbowman":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_crossbowman","name":"Elite Famiglia Crossbowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Famiglia-trained crossbowmen with a wealth of experience. Their shots are more accurate, and more deadly as well. Famiglie always respect the ironclad order, so these crossbows are never upgraded into better models, and Arts remain just as essential as ever.","abilities":["While under the Asset Liquidation status, attacks are converted into Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":380,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"famiglia_terrorizer":{"slug":"famiglia_terrorizer","name":"Famiglia Terrorizer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Terrorizer.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An exceptionally herculean famiglia strongman, known for his fiery temper. He does not begrudge the visits he pays to the relatives of others, but during key moments, his word is more resolute than stone.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by allied units","Increases Blood Debt when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":600,"def":1100,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"siracusan_civilian":{"slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"elite_famiglia_soldier":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_soldier","name":"Elite Famiglia Soldier","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Soldier.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Battle-hardened, low-level mafiosi who are strong and swift-footed, worthy of being called elite fighters. When they are buried, the famiglia might send a letter of condolence home, nothing more.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt by a miniscule amount when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4400,"atk":375,"def":180,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"famiglia_luxury_limo":{"slug":"famiglia_luxury_limo","name":"Famiglia Luxury Limo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Luxury Limo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A lesser-seen vehicle among the famiglie, sporting an unassuming exterior but a luxurious interior. Generally, these are only used to welcome the most distinguished of the famiglia's guests, and to convey to them the graces of the famiglia's high-ranking members.","abilities":["Unloads 3 <Elite Famiglia Soldiers> if this is unit is defeated while blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1100,"def":1300,"res":15,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"famiglia_heavy_capo":{"slug":"famiglia_heavy_capo","name":"Famiglia Heavy Capo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Heavy Capo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A ruthless famiglia capo who has commanded the awe of a great many mafiosi. He was there when the famiglie first rose to greatness, and withstood the tumultuous years of change up until the present. It seems that nothing can topple him now.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt whenever an enemy unit is defeated within range"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9500,"atk":600,"def":500,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi":{"slug":"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi","name":"Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Il Signore dei Lupi was born in the wilderness, but he has cast his gaze upon the world of men. His hubris is boundless, yet he falls short. His tricks exhausted, he has lost everything. Now, someone must be made to bear his wrath.","abilities":["Gradually increases Blood Debt","First Form","Damage taken is reduced and cannot be Stunned","[Hemolytic Horror] Causes 3 friendly units to be consumed by fear, greatly reducing their ASPD, significantly accelerating their periodic HP loss, and causing them to be unable to be retreated manually; affected units will return to normal after 'Signore dei Lupi' loses a certain pe